{"id":96775630583143,"name":"A Broken Dream","desc":"A story game with horror aspects inspired by liminal spaces, dreamcore, and weirdcore. This is NOT a backrooms game.\n\nThe dream pills put the user in a guaranteed state of permanent sleep, bound to be wandering in their own lucid dreams forever. Escape reality and enter a surreal paradise, where anything your mind thinks of comes true.\n\nSupports both singleplayer and multiplayer. Supports PC, Mobile, and Console.\n\nCreated mostly as a solo project;\n\nInspired by dreamcore, weirdcore, liminal spaces, the backrooms, but mostly the first two. The game’s environment has very unique and amazing aesthetics.\n\nThe game also has an original soundtrack (OST) completely made by Snoogle (the solo developer mentioned previously). \n\nFeel free to leave feedback or support the game.\n\nFanart Thumbnail Creators: kenzie4076, enoskevich, Porkparrot ","path":"/game/96775630583143-a-broken-dream","slug":"96775630583143-a-broken-dream","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4a06d51ba30bd6ffd697ac432192f2f229f2161eb278f8a4efcb52ae412b27f4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1f7f2ec0c16078d2c6967651d4eb2d19/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1184,"visitor":45690124,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-20T16:30:27.606Z","creator":{"name":"Snap Shot Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6ad5622bb7097e4ee09d7059","title":"activate all computers","game":{"_id":"6ad5622bb7097e4ee09d7058","gameId":96775630583143,"name":"A Broken Dream","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4a06d51ba30bd6ffd697ac432192f2f229f2161eb278f8a4efcb52ae412b27f4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1f7f2ec0c16078d2c6967651d4eb2d19/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"96775630583143-a-broken-dream","path":"/game/96775630583143-a-broken-dream","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4a06d51ba30bd6ffd697ac